### Two process notes worth flagging
1. **Step 7's result artifacts were missing** when I went to verify — the diagnostic subagent's in-loop `rm -f results.*.json` wiped them on exit. I re-ran the 8-round sweep myself to both confirm the green claim independently and persist `results.{1..8}.json` (the required output artifact). All 8 rounds passed 74/74.
2. **I hit the `cd`-propagation gotcha twice** (the one in my memory note): with `--start-command "bash start.sh"` plus an outer `cd`, every test ERRORs because the per-test-server *relaunch* doesn't inherit the outer cwd. Fixed by embedding `cd $IMPL && bash start.sh` directly in `--start-command`, after which all rounds went green. The memory note was correct; I just didn't apply it on the first two attempts.

The final contract document is `workspace/PRD_COMPLETED.md`; the full per-step trace (verbatim subagent summaries) is in `worklog.md`.
